the first try of defalation use the algebraic structure
and update linear transform with one E lambdai's left inverse, 
which is perpendicular to E lambdai. This does not work actually.

The core geometric idea is that linear tranform effect
to a vector is just the same as linear transform effect to
the vector's oblique projection to all the eigen spaces of this
linear transform. The oblique projection can be reached by
applying an outter product of two matrix if we choose the
right basis of A-lambdai null space and left null space
basis. The choice is called dual gram-schmit process. 
